{"server":"tw","storyId":"act7d5_level_act7d5_st01","groupId":"act7d5","stageId":null,"title":"來辦聯歡會吧","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act7d5/level_act7d5_st01.txt","sourceHash":"2fe0e25c70edce9f4b1f65d0bd98a76bb88f813a720b7ea010b14a3017df5b75","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"narration","text":"04:22 P.M.  天氣/晴\n羅德島艦船，第五艙室，訓練場"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喝！哈啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"劈砍！直刺！平揮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......哈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的......體能訓練......呼，呼，終於完成了。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"注意極限，你對自己太嚴格了。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"不，呼......不要緊！我沒問題的，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"我很清楚自己的狀況，現在這樣的訓練強度還在可以負擔的範圍之內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"之前雷蛇前輩和杜賓教官一起幫我調整了訓練表，請不要擔心我！"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"呼哈......呼哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？怎麼了，博士，怎麼滿臉擔憂的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，不用擔心，雖然的確很累，不過我能撐住！"}]},{"label":"來，運動飲料。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，呼哈......哈......謝謝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊......終於又活過來了。不過這個飲料，噁，還是老樣子好難喝啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"杜賓教官強調過好幾次，運動之後喝這個對身體比較好，芙蘭卡前輩也這麼說，但是真的味道好怪。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"來這裡訓練的幹員們都好努力，我也要加油，不能拖大家的後腿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"啊對了博士，過兩天我要和黑鋼的前輩們一起出任務，暫時不會來訓練場，這段時間非常感謝您的指導！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你看起來好像還有話想說。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"這、不愧是博士......我表現得很明顯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"這次，能和前輩們一起出任務，我當然很開心。只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"我，呃，養了一些小動物，那個，平常都是我在照顧，但是要出任務的話，就只好拜託其他同伴暫時照看了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"一般來說，我都是拜託黑鋼的前輩們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"雷蛇前輩和芙蘭卡前輩都經常幫忙，不過兩位前輩總是一起出任務，休息時間也經常一起行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"如果找不到其中的一個人的話，另一個基本也就沒指望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"別看芙蘭卡前輩平時總是愛開玩笑，其實她相當可靠，圓圓、小尖、大黑還有堅強，大家都很喜歡芙蘭卡前輩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"偶爾找不到兩位前輩的時候，潔西卡也會幫忙照顧，不過，呃，她之前差點被大黑嚇哭。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"能問一下......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你養的都是些什麼‘小動物’嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"咦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有帶圓圓他們和博士打過招呼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"圓圓小刺和大黑都是源石蝸牛，堅強是小型薩爾貢沙漠磐蟹，大家都是很可愛的！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？怎麼了嗎，博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"不好......博士你的這個眼神，不、不行哦，不能吃，圓圓小刺大黑還有堅強都不能吃！我知道您有瞞著凱爾希醫生吃一些奇怪的零食！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"（本來還想拜託博士幫忙照顧的，這樣看來，哎，還是算了吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"傷腦筋了，這次大家一起出任務，圓圓他們該怎麼辦才好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......其他幹員的話，大家好像都有各自的事情要做，貿然拜託是不是不太好？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"試試看？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"比如說，拜託接下來路過的幹員。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？！這也太草率了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，您是認真的嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"會是誰，來的會是誰......嗚嗚，希望會是個可靠的人......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有人來了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"腳步聲......好輕！這種步調的節奏，很穩，來的人一定是個優秀的戰士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？有香味？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得這個香味應該是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"玫蘭莎小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，還有香草小姐，下午好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，請問......兩位找我有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，難得你拜託我，我卻......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"沒這回事！玫蘭莎小姐明明幫了大忙，太感謝了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"這沒什麼，我也只是轉而拜託了史都華德而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，能幫上忙，我很開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"（臉紅了！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，玫蘭莎小姐在戰鬥以外的場合還是那麼容易害羞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"請兩位放心，照顧香草小姐的小動物這件事就交給我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"真是太麻煩您了，非常感謝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝，史都華德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"兩人都太客氣啦，特別是香草小姐，完全沒必要用敬稱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這怎麼行！兩位都比我要更早加入羅德島，是我的前輩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"太誇張了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，說起來，原來這次任務玫蘭莎小姐也會一起去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"完全沒聽前輩們提起過啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"這是臨時決定的，我也剛被通知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"是師傅，啊，就是芙蘭卡小姐，說要檢查一下我的劍術，正好有機會，就申請讓我也加入小隊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，芙蘭卡前輩？前輩指導玫蘭莎小姐劍術嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"前輩，真的有在好好指導嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然那個人該認真的地方很可靠，但是，不會和認真的玫蘭莎小姐灌輸什麼奇怪的東西吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，不行，越想越覺得好擔憂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的！不是這樣！芙蘭卡小姐雖然總是愛開玩笑，但是她在劍術上非常認真！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧了芙蘭卡小姐，我才能像現在這樣進步！而且，師傅並沒有教我什麼奇怪的東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我有點激動了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"看來玫蘭莎小姐和芙蘭卡前輩關係很好嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，看來前輩也有在好好教導劍術，那我就放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡前輩的劍術真的很厲害，在黑鋼的時候，交流會上單比劍術我還沒見前輩輸過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"師傅很厲害，我要學習的還有很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那個，對不起，到時間了，我該走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"和安賽爾約好了，今天要做一個常規檢查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"常規檢查？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。是礦石病的檢查......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"......這樣啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，怎麼這麼頻繁，我記得前兩天不是剛檢查過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"而且上次檢查之後，醫療組那邊給你換了新的藥劑吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，換了新藥，所以要去複查一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"不用擔心，華法琳醫生也說，目前病症已經被控制住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"......是嗎，那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來的事情就放心交給我，你快去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"這次真的很感謝！等玫蘭莎小姐的檢查結束，如果不介意的話，我們一起去喝茶怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，喝茶？......嗯，嗯！好啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"那就說好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玫蘭莎","speakerId":"char_208_melan","isRemote":false,"text":"史都華德，接下來就拜託了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，香草小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼。不要在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"總感覺......玫蘭莎小姐好像改變了不少，變得愛笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"香草小姐也這麼覺得？比起我們剛組成小隊的時候，玫蘭莎小姐現在要自信得多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"自信......嗎？嗯，沒錯，就是自信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"一直覺得羅德島的大家，和我曾經見過的感染者有哪裡不太一樣，大概就是因為大家都還在努力生活，並不看輕自己吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"有的時候我甚至會忘記大家是感染者這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"真不可思議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，不可思議嗎，我倒不這麼覺得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島雖然也被迫捲進了不少事情裡，但本質上還是醫藥公司，一直都是以藥物的研發和對感染者的救治作為核心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"會聚集到這裡的感染者，本來也都是一些還不願意放棄自己，還在尋求治療的人，不是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說的話，倒的確是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"所以很多時候，我們才會更加需要和各種組織合作，補充自身不足的地方......比如說，和黑鋼的合作就是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"能夠借助像香草小姐這樣的專業人士的力量，我們這些幹員的壓力也減輕了許多，得要感謝大家才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡，我還算不上是專業人士，現在還是個實習生，前輩們才是有經驗的專業雇傭兵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"和雷蛇前輩他們可能不太一樣，我是參加了考核，才拿到羅德島的交換名額。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"考核？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，考核。實戰和筆試都有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"為了筆試能合格，我還在圖書室通宵了整整一個禮拜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈哈，真是辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"不過有點意外啊，這樣聽起來，黑鋼對合作好像比我想得要看重一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼說呢......因為礦石病的爆發，所以黑鋼內部其實也有不少傭兵被感染。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"組織裡倒是還好，對於雇傭兵來說，礦石病大概也不怎麼可怕，畢竟我們本身的工作在一般人看來就挺危險的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟不管哪一種，都是會要命的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，雖然我們不怎麼在意，但委託方卻大多不太願意雇傭感染者。接到的委託變少，賺不到錢，估計讓上頭的人也很頭痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"和羅德島的合作，大概就是從那個時候開始的吧？我從芙蘭卡前輩那裡聽過一點，具體的就不太清楚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"也幸好我有拿到名額，才能像現在這樣，見到許多從沒見過的東西，接觸許多不同的人，每一天都非常充實！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，食堂每周一次的免費甜點實在是太好吃了！交換來這裡之後，我可能已經長胖了好多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"沒這回事。只要保持營養均衡，多吃一點也很好，不過不建議暴飲暴食哦，健康是最重要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，史都華德先生你不懂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"和別人覺得行不行沒關係，這是會影響自己心情的問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這樣啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對對，說得沒錯，小香草很懂嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，煌小姐！......咦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"煌小姐，這個孩子是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你問這個小蘿蔔頭？這姑娘叫朵拉，是我的一個小朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，怎麼還叫小姐，都說了不用敬語了，你這傢伙腦筋真硬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朵拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_045","isRemote":false,"text":"......哥哥姐姐好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"下午好，朵拉小姐，今天有乖乖吃藥嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朵拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_045","isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"卻以藥太苦為藉口，拉著我講了半個小時故事書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"小壞蛋，別以為我不知道，上次你說藥苦，凱爾希醫生之後就改良了藥水的口味！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朵拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_045","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是很難喝嘛！煌姐姐不也說難喝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我喝的那種不一樣，別想找藉口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朵拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_045","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朵拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_045","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，該回去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，到上課的時間了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朵拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_045","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，醫療姐姐教我們做手工，今天學折紙花！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"那我用糖果來換，你學會了也幫我折一朵吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朵拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_045","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿嘿，那我考慮一下哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朵拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_045","isRemote":false,"text":"哥哥姐姐拜拜！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"慢點，慢點，別跑太快，小心摔跤——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......摔了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"這小鬼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，真有活力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"是吧，看起來文文靜靜的，其實放著不管就能上房揭瓦，只能拿華法琳來嚇唬她乖乖聽話......算了，不提這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你們兩個怎麼會湊在一起，小香草，平時不都是跟黑鋼那幾個一起的？幹嘛，阿米婭終於打算要搞我們和合作夥伴的聯歡會了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？這、不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"煌小姐，就別開這樣的玩笑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來像玩笑嗎？可惜，其實我還真的滿想開個聯歡會，大家一起放鬆放鬆的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"會有機會。而且，私下裡不是已經辦過好多場了嗎？煌小姐都喝吐好幾個合作方幹員了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"那都是私下裡，那不一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"原來上次雷蛇前輩說的，噩夢一樣的聯歡酒會，就是這麼回事啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，剛剛那個女孩，也是羅德島的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"朵拉嗎？她是來這裡治療的，也算是編內人員吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"算。不過和你我的檔案歸類都不同，戰鬥人員在人事檔案上都是做特殊處理的，另外後勤檔案也是單獨管理的......吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼語氣這麼不確定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"這方面我不熟嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，很在意朵拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"這個，的確有一點。我剛來的時候好像也見過她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"說來聽聽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"那個時候，我來找博士遞交我的檔案資料，有個長得很可愛的感染者女孩和她的父母就在門外等候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"那個女孩雖然還很小，但是很懂事，不吵也不鬧，就一直抱著一個破破爛爛的玩偶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"明明也沒什麼大不了的，但總覺得有點在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"那就沒錯了，的確是朵拉，她那個玩偶破得不行了，我說要給她買個新的，她又不要，最後還是去拜託柏喙幫她縫補了一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"果然是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"那孩子我記得......是維多利亞人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說是？她病歷上寫的是被捲進了街頭爭鬥，吸入了過量的源石粉末。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前幫芙蓉哄這小孩打針的時候看過一眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"那個病房的孩子，遭遇雖然各有不同，但現在的處境都很相似。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"卡緹經常去陪孩子們玩，安賽爾也總會在晚上發藥之後留下來給他們說說故事什麼的，大家都是很樂觀的好孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"朵拉這丫頭明顯樂觀過頭了吧，還總說長大以後要加入我的行動小組，你說她怎麼這麼想不開？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"加入煌小姐的小組，那的確是想不開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"喂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"這種故事在這裡還算挺常見的。光是在醫療組的一個治療區，估計就能找出好幾個擁有類似經歷的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"的確不新鮮，這世道真是爛透了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"她......是不是病得很重？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"而且那家人看起來也並不富裕......不像是能付得起診金的樣子，說實話，我有點沒想到居然還能再次看到她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"正常來說，如果決策人沒瘋，的確是不會接受沒錢還病得快死掉的病人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣說真的好嗎......哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"不過煌小姐說得對，目前還沒有能夠治癒礦石病的方法，就算有救治組織，資源也非常有限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以感染者的處境，才會更加艱難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，羅德島沒有拒絕這些人吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的規模不小，但要說和真正的大組織相比，卻也沒有什麼可比性，相差太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"來到羅德島之後，我看到過很多人。很多感染的人，來到這裡求醫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"在這些病人之中，有人站出來，說願意走上戰場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"A4預備小隊的大家都是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"史都華德先生也是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"在參加黑鋼的合作專案之前，我甚至沒有聽說過這樣一個組織。一個......救治感染者，甚至可以不收取任何報酬的組織。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"這不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼，不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不是不收取任何報酬，而是可以‘不收取金錢報酬’。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"單方面的付出那太沉重了，對雙方都一樣重，沒法長久，就算是阿米婭她人再好，也不會去做這樣的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可以提供治療，但絕不是免費。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"看！一個好例子就站在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，煌小姐，再拍我的肩膀可能就要開裂了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以選擇做一切對羅德島有幫助的事，來換取羅德島提供的治療，當然，不僅僅是戰鬥，不如說戰鬥人員才是最稀少的那一小撮人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"處理書面材料的後勤，維護羅德島本體正常運作的工程人員，與各個分支點聯繫的外派員還有日常的採購和清潔人員......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至你想去食堂洗碗，都沒問題。只要你想，只要有益。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"再聽一遍，還是覺得這真是理想化的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"討厭嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"完全不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"（吹口哨）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，可是！像朵拉這樣的小孩子，又能幫羅德島什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，他們接下來要學習折紙花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"他們折的紙花，接下來會用來裝飾聯歡會的會場，會發給每一個回到艦船上的幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼時候定的聯歡會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛。我定的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"這不重要，重要的是，勞有所得，這些小傢伙做的事和我做的事看起來不同，但其實對羅德島來說都很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，我知道你們有人私下裡說羅德島是黑心企業對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"那是開玩笑，開玩笑而已！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，我想逗逗博士的時候也是這麼說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"煌小姐！認真一點啦......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我的想法可能和煌小姐不太一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"我們之中，有一些人用為羅德島做事為條件，來換取治療，而更多的人另有自己要做的事，只是恰巧和羅德島的方向一致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，也有許多真正相信阿米婭他們的理念，願意為此獻出一切的人在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"（口哨）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"大家未必擁有相同的意志，只是恰巧在這條路上方向一致，才在這一刻並肩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像明白點了，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，不用想得太複雜也可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看來，現在就很好了，大家都在一點點地變得更好，這種感覺真的很讓人開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"香草小姐也是，最近笑容變多了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，欸，是這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"可能就是因為在羅德島很充實吧，雖然還是有很多不習慣的東西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"比如說會突然自動打開的門之類的，還有，上次在走道裡的時候，醫療車突然朝我搭話......我真的嚇了一跳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，看來香草小姐真的很不擅長應付這種類型的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"安德切爾上次還和我說，他幫能天使小姐做的玩具橡皮筋銃，被香草小姐直接掰斷了一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"原來那個是他做的嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"對、對不起，因為被跳出來的橡皮筋嚇了一跳，所以下意識就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"真的很抱歉！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係的，安德切爾並沒有生氣，他這個人就是這樣，話不多，但心地不壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"這我可以作證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，嗯，如果他再拿著什麼奇怪的機械去找你，給你造成困擾的話，可以來找我，或者玫蘭莎小姐都可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，說到這裡啊，我突然覺得，黑心組織這說法其實還挺有道理的不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"......這又是在說什麼呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我們對這些孩子，這叫什麼，提前投資？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"提前......投資？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，還挺值的吧？羅德島會教這些孩子許多東西，小傢伙們可能許多方面比你我還強點，至少我一看那些數字和符號就頭疼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"他們說不定以後都會變得很厲害，比我厲害得多，也許能做到許多我做不到的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼一想，我們賺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"賺什麼啊？又不一定——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"別說。噓，讓我做做夢，別說了啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，是阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"看樣子又是任務，想翹班，乾脆翹班吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先走了啊——香草，史都華德，等聯歡會定下來了我們一起喝一杯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然嘴上這麼說，但是還是很有精神地走掉了呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"真的要辦聯歡會嗎？我、我不會喝酒怎麼辦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。別在意，煌小姐一直是這樣，不會真的強迫你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"不會嗎？那也有點讓人失望......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，到我的房間了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"請進，不用客氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"那就打擾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......這裡就是香草小姐的房間啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"有點亂，讓你見笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，圓圓他們在這邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"圓圓？真是個可愛......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"......的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"香草小姐，你說的小動物就是，這裡的，這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都是在我家鄉很常見的生物，很可愛吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"（可愛這個詞到底是什麼意思來著......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，史都華德先生別擔心，大黑雖然體型大，但是性格是最溫順的，一點都不危險！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......每次在戰場上我都很難下得了手，杜賓教官總是會罵我，可是真的沒辦法啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"能、能看得出來，香草小姐是真的很喜歡動物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......嗯，這些小動物，呃，都很有個性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，對吧對吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"圓圓他們都很乖，一般不會搗亂，只要每天加一點水和食物就好！很好照顧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不過要小心，不能擠壓到大黑殼上的這些尖角。否則......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"否則？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"會爆炸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"爆"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"香草小姐，在房間裡養這樣的小動物真的沒問題嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？沒問題哦！阿米婭和凱爾希醫生都給了許可！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"這個保溫箱的材質比較特殊，可以隔絕源石的影響，非常安全！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，食物我已經提前貯備好了......看，只要按下這邊的按鈕，像這樣，就會自動餵食了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，很神奇吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我覺得，還是會養源石蟲的你比較神奇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，餵水的話，隔一天給一點點就好，這樣環境會比較乾燥，更像我老家那邊的自然環境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了，我會注意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"這些源石蝸牛，還有磐蟹，長得比我見過的都要好看一些......香草小姐的故鄉，我記得應該是薩爾貢吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯哦。是薩爾貢一個很偏僻的鄉下地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"那是個什麼樣的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"是個......嗯，非常貧窮的地方，資源也很匱乏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"部落的四周都是黃沙，因為很難耕作，想要生存下去，就必須要外出狩獵，部族裡的每一個孩子，都會被培養為優秀的獵手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"香草小姐也是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"那為什麼後來又加入黑鋼......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來有點難為情......是因為缺錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"缺錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。黑鋼，黑鋼國際，簡單來講就是雇傭兵的組織。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"或許加入的大家目的各不相同，不過還是有不少人是因為缺錢才做傭兵的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然也不例外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣嗎，但是，潔西卡小姐看起來不像是缺錢的樣子啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡前輩......好像有一些別的理由，前輩不太說這些事，我知道得也不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"我的家鄉，非常貧瘠......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"薩爾貢的沙漠偶爾會下雨，當綠洲的水聚成小湖，就會有商隊橫穿整個沙漠，在路過我們的部落時也會稍作停留，拿出一些貨物來交易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"多數是以物易物，大家都沒有什麼錢，但可以交換的東西各家各戶總還有一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"商隊一般只會停留一兩天，晚上非常冷的時候，大家就不分彼此，都圍著火堆坐在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"吃一點肉乾，大人們喝兩口酒驅寒，給孩子們一把沙棗，當做零嘴吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"商人們總會給小孩子們說一些沙漠外面的事，一般都是些新鮮的，好玩的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"比如在很遠很遠的東方，有遍地鮮花的香氛都市，還有流淌著財富與幸福的巨大都城......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來真不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"是吧？不過，我出來之後，暫時還沒找到什麼機會去驗證東方到底有沒有那麼好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼說，聽過這種故事，自然就會對外界產生好奇，也就很難再繼續待在沙漠裡，當一個普通獵人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我跟著商人走出來，到了沙漠邊緣的小城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"然後發現，外面並沒有聽起來的那麼好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"是沒那麼好，不過也不算很差......嗯，至少吃的東西比我老家要好一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"我身上沒帶多少錢，雖然那已經是我的全部身家，但是還是不夠用，旅店也不敢住，因為太貴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"當傭兵是沒得選，不過，我並不後悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"......不說這個了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"別光說我，史都華德先生的故鄉是哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"我嗎？我是謝拉格人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！我有聽說過，據說那裡一年四季都會下雪，是不是？我還從來沒有看過能堆積起來的雪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，在羅德島的話，之後說不定會有機會見到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎！那我得趕緊存錢，聽潔西卡說，新型的人體隔絕型保暖機還挺貴的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈，我覺得保暖應該也不必做到這個地步吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"這次能被香草小姐拜託，玫蘭莎小姐真的很開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然她表現得可能不太明顯，這既是她的優點，同時也是她的缺點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣嗎......？不會麻煩到你們就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"不會哦。不管是我，還是玫蘭莎小姐，我相信沒有人會覺得麻煩的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼就請香草小姐安心去出任務吧，圓圓他們就請放心交給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，請等一等，史都華德先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"史都華德","speakerId":"char_210_stward","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？還有什麼事情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"那個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我還不能說完全理解了史都華德先生和煌小姐的想法，但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"下次A4預備隊的大家再去看望那些在接受治療的孩子們的時候，也請叫上我一起吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"大家一起，為聯歡會做準備，來學習折紙花吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_208_melan","aliases":["玫蘭莎"]},{"speakerId":"char_210_stward","aliases":["史都華德"]},{"speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","aliases":["香草"]}]}
